HS5878.statement:
设$M=\int_{-\frac{\pi}{2}}^{\frac{\pi}{2}}\cos^{4} x\sin^{3} x \mathrm{d}
x$，$N=\int_{-\frac{\pi}{2}}^{\frac{\pi}{2}}\left(\cos^{3} x+\sin^{3} x\right
) \mathrm{d}x$，$P=\int_{-\frac{\pi}{2}}^{\frac{\pi}{2}}\left(x\cos x-\sin^{2}
x\right) \mathrm{d}x$，则（　　　　）.

（A）$M>N>P$

（B）$N>P>M$

（C）$N>M>P$

（D）$M>P>N$
